tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/8183169a0ea2a3d8101bf462efac6896.webm?t=1752205441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she become a singing sensation? A Top 100 streamer? A pro gamer? An idol? Or will she return to reality and become a hydraulic engineer, only singing at the annual company party? Her future is in your hands\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Her Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While streaming or going out, Viona meets many other VTubers, each with unique personalities, stories, and fates\u2026 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Wooluna Channel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wooluna, nicknamed Loona, claims to be a versatile VTuber, constantly quoting classical poetry and sounding extremely knowledgeable. Her fans, however, love teasing her with absurd puns. One day, she suddenly stopped streaming without warning. When she returned weeks later, her tone and personality had changed dramatically. A new person-inside, perhaps? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/01bd3ca1890f2987e3606b7d619feea1.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/01bd3ca1890f2987e3606b7d619feea1.apng?t=1752205441\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/3062b438b4a394dcfdb0a36cd5146244.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/3062b438b4a394dcfdb0a36cd5146244.apng?t=1752205441\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6President Rowling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rowling is a popular VTuber known for her witty banter\u2014especially teasing shy young men\u2014making her a fan favorite. After gaining fame, she founded a VTuber agency called <strong>Gracelive</strong> and successfully promoted several rising talents. She jokes about being a ruthless capitalist but treats her streamers decently. Still\u2026 things aren\u2019t always as smooth as they seem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/98288ab9cc7c6bb80c252af345149a67.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/98288ab9cc7c6bb80c252af345149a67.apng?t=1752205441\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/29f0e2bb99ec81520dfc8df79ad2a185.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/29f0e2bb99ec81520dfc8df79ad2a185.webm?t=1752205441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6\u2605Keno-chan\u2605</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keno is a mischievous VTuber who loves pulling stunts\u2014whether it\u2019s fake beheadings, splits, walking red carpets, or streaming her naps. Her streams are always full of laughs. But after a certain scandal, she was hit with mass backlash and platform-wide bans on these antics, similar to how massive ASMR content was once abruptly shut down. She lost fans and direction. Will Viona help her find her way again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/85335e4683716ada734b85b2ceb0495d.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/85335e4683716ada734b85b2ceb0495d.apng?t=1752205441\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/d51641fae6978adac94c31c2c73be1a0.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/d51641fae6978adac94c31c2c73be1a0.webm?t=1752205441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Senho Takanashi is Invincible</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Senho is a bizarre VTuber claiming to be a sorceress from another world. She supposedly slashed through dimensions with a time-blade in a fight with a demon king. Now, the &quot;Crystal&quot; wants to label and protect her, while the &quot;Black Coffin Research Institute&quot; seeks to revive the demon king using her powers. She says she needs her fans\u2019 faith as magic fuel to resist them. Of course, no one believes any of this. They just think her deadpan seriousness is hilarious\u2014maybe a little too deep into the roleplay, or perhaps she\u2019s terminally chuunibyo...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/97ff2c5ea4d2c017a4c9b0726d990350.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/97ff2c5ea4d2c017a4c9b0726d990350.webm?t=1752205441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/2bf2dd4ad826142cdcf28e2a6ce53291.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/2bf2dd4ad826142cdcf28e2a6ce53291.webm?t=1752205441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Yumi_Official</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yumi was once a singer in the music category with a sizable fanbase before adopting a virtual identity. She\u2019s timid and only feels truly confident when singing. That fear has caused her to miss many opportunities. Though her background is different from the protagonist\u2019s, they share the same goal\u2014becoming a star. Yumi hopes to shine in a talent show. Can she overcome her inner fears?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/db06dd4bb22684f1545b50da3327ec1a.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/db06dd4bb22684f1545b50da3327ec1a.apng?t=1752205441\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/da4c250ec7022189f2959e86ba8f09ec.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/da4c250ec7022189f2959e86ba8f09ec.gif?t=1752205441\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer's Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by <i><strong>Needy Streamer Overload</strong></i> and <i><strong>VA-11 Hall-A</strong></i>, both of which I personally love. But the gameplay and story here are totally different\u2014for me, pixel aesthetics hitting all the right nostalgia notes. So, the game was orginally based on Chinese VTuber community but now it has been localized and will be refined constantly to make it less exotic and focus on some VTuber common sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game outcomes are based on character attributes (Vocal, Chat, and Skill) and relationships with others. Most events lean toward a humorous tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m what you\u2019d call a <strong>heavy VTuber addict</strong>\u2014I subscribed a few hundred channels but of course, for some DD, this isn't worth saying. I\u2019ve been watching since 2019 and even considered starting my own VTuber group. I've witnessed the evolution of the scene: the JP VTuber era, CN VTuber boom, the fall of hardcore RP VTuber, the &quot;everyone\u2019s clowning&quot; trend, the &quot;honry bait&quot; age, the rise of some &quot;beyond-understanding&quot; VTubers, and these year\u2019s drama overload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players unfamiliar with VTubers or the VTuber scene, the game includes an <strong>explainer notebook</strong> filled with definitions of slang and popular memes. Of course, you can turn it off if you prefer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/0f119227ae0abb61bf5c0ca54aa62f5e.poster.avif?t=1752205441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289560/extras/0f119227ae0abb61bf5c0ca54aa62f5e.webm?t=1752205441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please wishlist this game if you're interested, thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our X: @Transparkles</p>",
